@startuml SEQ_19_MELIHAT_SERTIFIKAT_PRAKTIKUM
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12\nskinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-19: Melihat Sertifikat Praktikum

actor       "Admin / Asisten / Dosen / Kadep"  as User
boundary    "Browser"                          as Browser
control     "PraktikumSertifikatController"    as Controller
entity      "SertifikatPraktikum Model"        as Model
database    "sertifikat_praktikum"             as DB

== Lihat Halaman Sertifikat ==

User    ->  Browser    : Buka menu "Sertifikat" di halaman praktikum
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/sertifikat
Controller -> Model    : Query sertifikat berdasarkan praktikum
Model -> DB            : SELECT sertifikat_praktikum WHERE praktikum_id = ?
DB --> Model           : Data sertifikat
Model --> Controller   : Data sertifikat
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman sertifikat
Browser    --> User    : Daftar sertifikat\n(view-only)

== Download Sertifikat ==

User    ->  Browser    : Klik "Download" pada sertifikat
Browser ->  Controller : GET /praktikum/{id}/sertifikat/{sertifikat}/download
Controller -> Model    : Query sertifikat
Model -> DB            : SELECT sertifikat_praktikum WHERE id = {id}
DB --> Model           : Data sertifikat
Model --> Controller   : Data sertifikat
Controller --> Browser : Download file sertifikat PDF
Browser    --> User    : File sertifikat PDF diunduh

@enduml
